{"unit_id":"Lenonss__DSH_VsCodeMode#card-zh","repo":"Lenonss/DSH_VsCodeMode","commit":"344c2d5aa6249d48adb27dbc743eddec1b74b038","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-vscode-mode**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DSH 会话中提供类 VS Code 的代码工作台。它将 Monaco 编辑器、文件导航和开发工具接入 DSH 侧栏与会话界面，支持多文件页签、QuickOpen、命令面板、代码片段和文件预览；还可审查 agent 产生的代码差异，使用 LSP 查询定义、引用与悬停信息，在编辑器中设置断点和调试，并通过 SVN 面板查看状态、差异与日志。界面状态按工作区保存并可在重启后恢复。适合希望在 DSH 对话旁直接检查和编辑项目代码的开发者。基础编辑无需 API Key；SVN、语言服务器和调试能力需对应本机工具或适配器。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:132-170","src/client/ui/EditorView.ts:3-7","src/client/index.ts:145-160"]}
{"unit_id":"Lenonss__DSH_VsCodeMode#card-en","repo":"Lenonss/DSH_VsCodeMode","commit":"344c2d5aa6249d48adb27dbc743eddec1b74b038","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-vscode-mode** adds a VS Code-style workbench to DSH web with Monaco editing, file search, tabs, and snippets. It supports agent diff review, LSP navigation, breakpoint debugging, and SVN status and diffs. Workspace UI state persists across restarts. Advanced features need local tools.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:132-170","src/client/ui/EditorView.ts:3-7","src/client/index.ts:145-160"]}
